{"message":"Based on the current offers I found, the strongest active sign-up bonus is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or Rho-Bank checking deposit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. The offer runs through December 15, 2025. Returns, chargebacks, disputed transactions, balance transfers, cash equivalents, and fees do not count toward the requirement. The card has a $50 annual fee and a 19.99% purchase APR on carried balances.

I did not find an active quantified sign-up cash-back bonus. The previously advertised $500 Silver Rewards Card statement-credit offer expired June 30, 2025. If you qualify as a business applicant, there are also promotional cash-back multipliers, but they are not lump-sum sign-up bonuses.

So, if your priority is the largest available promotional bonus in points or cash value, I’d consider the EcoCard—provided you can comfortably meet the $5,000 one-month spending requirement. Otherwise, it may be better to wait for or compare a future cash-back sign-up offer."}
